.el .ds Aq '
.TH RATASH-RULE-ADD 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.1" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-rule\-add \- Insert one complete Rule String at an explicit position
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash rule add\fR [\fB\-\-prepend\fR] [\fB\-\-append\fR] [\fB\-\-before\fR] [\fB\-\-after\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIRULE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Insert one complete Rule String at an explicit position
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-prepend\fR
Insert before every existing rule
.TP
\fB\-\-append\fR
Insert after every existing rule
.TP
\fB\-\-before\fR \fI<BEFORE>\fR
Insert before this exact, complete Rule String
.TP
\fB\-\-after\fR \fI<AFTER>\fR
Insert after this exact, complete Rule String
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIRULE\fR>
Complete, case\-sensitive Mihomo Rule String to insert
